1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Start on New Product. This is where a new inventory item begins.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Add the item name, choose a category, and let the SKU fill in automatically.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Enter the list price, then uncheck discretion if you want to set a haggle floor.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Choose Lump Sum and enter what the materials cost for this item.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Add the build time. The site multiplies that by the labor rate in Settings.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Review the pricing summary. Profit updates from list price minus materials and labor.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
When everything looks right, click Create Product to save the inventory item.
